    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world of treachery, betrayal, and paw-some bravery, you are <strong>Francis the Frank</strong>, the noble dachshund once crowned king of the Weiner Kingdom. Stripped of your title during the <i>Great Wienie War</i> and cast into exile, you must rise once again to reclaim your throne and unite the fractured packs of the realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hot Dawg</strong> is an open-world action RPG where size doesn\u2019t matter\u2014heart does. Explore a vast medieval world filled with danger, quests, and absurdity as you forge your path back to glory. Will you take back what is rightfully yours, or will the Weiner Kingdom fall into the paws of chaos forever?<br><br><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Open World to Explore:</strong><br>Roam the sprawling Weiner Kingdom\u2014from rolling meadows and dense forests to haunted ruins and bustling doggy towns. Uncover secrets, solve puzzles, and find lost treasures hidden across a world that\u2019s both whimsical and dangerous.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world of treachery, betrayal, and paw-some bravery, you are <strong>Francis the Frank</strong>, the noble dachshund once crowned king of the Weiner Kingdom. Stripped of your title during the <i>Great Wienie War</i> and cast into exile, you must rise once again to reclaim your throne and unite the fractured packs of the realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hot Dawg</strong> is an open-world action RPG where size doesn\u2019t matter\u2014heart does. Explore a vast medieval world filled with danger, quests, and absurdity as you forge your path back to glory. Will you take back what is rightfully yours, or will the Weiner Kingdom fall into the paws of chaos forever?<br><br><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Open World to Explore:</strong><br>Roam the sprawling Weiner Kingdom\u2014from rolling meadows and dense forests to haunted ruins and bustling doggy towns. Uncover secrets, solve puzzles, and find lost treasures hidden across a world that\u2019s both whimsical and dangerous.</p>",
    "short_description": "Embark on a whimsical open-world adventure as Francis the Frank, a noble dachshund king betrayed during the Great Wienie War. In this action RPG, explore a vast medieval kingdom, battle rival breeds, complete quests, and reclaim your throne. Courage comes in all sizes\u2014will you rise again?",
